---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Documentación Técnica — AstroBranding Soberano">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 font-sans">
    <a href="/" class="text-xs text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-300 font-mono mb-8 inline-block">← Volver al inicio</a>

    <header class="mb-12 border-b border-neutral-800 pb-8">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-400 font-bold">Manual de Arquitectura</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mt-1 text-white">Malla Soberana de 10 Servicios en Zerops</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-neutral-400 mt-2">
        Plataforma fullstack de alto rendimiento ejecutando Bun, Astro 5 SSR, React 19, Hono, BullMQ y contenedores Incus LXC.
      </p>
    </header>

    <article class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-10 text-sm text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">1. Topología de la Malla de 10 Servicios</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 not-prose font-mono text-xs">
          <div class="p-4 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-xl">
            <span class="text-indigo-400 font-bold block mb-1">Runtimes (5)</span>
            <ul class="space-y-1 text-neutral-400">
              <li>• <strong class="text-white">astrobranding</strong>: Astro 5 SSR + Hono (:3000)</li>
              <li>• <strong class="text-white">bifrost</strong>: Maxim AI Gateway Go (:8080)</li>
              <li>• <strong class="text-white">freellmapi</strong>: Multi-LLM Proxy Node 22 (:3001)</li>
              <li>• <strong class="text-white">evolution</strong>: WhatsApp Engine Go (:8085)</li>
              <li>• <strong class="text-white">hermes</strong>: Autonomous Agent Python 3.12</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-xl">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold block mb-1">Managed Services (5)</span>
            <ul class="space-y-1 text-neutral-400">
              <li>• <strong class="text-white">database</strong>: PostgreSQL 18 (pgvector + uuidv7)</li>
              <li>• <strong class="text-white">valkey</strong>: Valkey 7.2 (BullMQ + Cache)</li>
              <li>• <strong class="text-white">nats</strong>: NATS 2.12 JetStream RPC</li>
              <li>• <strong class="text-white">objectstorage</strong>: S3 Object Storage</li>
              <li>• <strong class="text-white">localstorage</strong>: POSIX Shared Volume</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">2. Endpoints de la API Hono</h2>
        <div class="bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-xl p-4 font-mono text-xs not-prose space-y-2">
          <div class="text-emerald-400">GET  /health <span class="text-neutral-500">→ Monitoreo integral de la malla</span></div>
          <div class="text-indigo-400">POST /api/clients <span class="text-neutral-500">→ Alta de consultante (Drizzle)</span></div>
          <div class="text-indigo-400">POST /api/astrology/chart <span class="text-neutral-500">→ Cálculo natal (BullMQ)</span></div>
          <div class="text-indigo-400">POST /api/ai/chat <span class="text-neutral-500">→ Inferencia vía Bifrost Gateway</span></div>
          <div class="text-indigo-400">POST /api/whatsapp/otp <span class="text-neutral-500">→ Envío de token con EvolutionGo</span></div>
          <div class="text-amber-400">GET  /admin/queues <span class="text-neutral-500">→ Tablero interactivo Bull Board</span></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">3. Patrones de Resiliencia y Concurrencia</h2>
        <p>
          La plataforma combina el <strong>Transactional Outbox Pattern</strong> en PostgreSQL 18 para operaciones financieras y mutaciones de estado que no pueden perderse, con <strong>BullMQ sobre Valkey 7.2</strong> para colas pesadas de inferencia de IA y cálculos astrológicos asíncronos.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
